/// M30 HISTORY-048 "DI list: ids plus words".
/// Source: tests/baseline/t27_release_audit_test.go
/// symbol TestT27DIInventoryComplete (L35-78) plus
/// the ids list (L38-44) and the audit table
/// (docs/syntax-taste/t27-release-audit-2026-09-24.md
/// L67-92).
/// Disposition: historical_candidate (this row pins
/// the TestT27DIInventoryComplete offline pact as
/// reviewable Can facts; the old Go check stays until
/// the integrator retires it after every linked row,
/// variant, environment and control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the inventory legs in Go
/// order: the exact id bytes for all twenty-six
/// rows plus the exact audit word for every row,
/// with row and word tallies.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): each id
/// pins its Go literal inner bytes; each word pins
/// its audit table cell bytes; counts pin ints
/// tallied from the Go list plus the audit table.
/// id-di-01 pins DI-01 (L39); disp-di-01 pins
/// accepted (audit L67);
/// id-di-02 pins DI-02 (L39); disp-di-02 pins
/// accepted (audit L68);
/// id-di-03 pins DI-03 (L39); disp-di-03 pins
/// deferred (audit L69);
