/// deferred (audit L92); id-count
/// pins int (26) from L38-44; accepted-count pins
/// int (9); retained-count pins int (3);
/// deferred-count pins int (9); unselected-count
/// pins int (1); unattested-count pins int (4),
/// each tallied from audit L67-92.
